00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,867
Why does change feel so difficult?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,900
Every time we repeat a behavior, it can become easier, and more automatic.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,867
New behaviors take a different route. They often require more attention, and practice.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,467
The good news?

5
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,700
Repetition helps new habits become familiar.
